jx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.404em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>114</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>∘</mo></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-incorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/incorrect-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-incorrectText\">Incorrect</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><div id=\"graphic-q-21727-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-21727-e-0\"></div>\n\n\n<p>First, notice that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"19\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 1.175em; margin-bottom: -0.561em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s4\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.951em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D442 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"20\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 1.177em; margin-bottom: -0.561em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s4\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.951em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D442 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D438 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> are adjacent because they share the same side <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-h class=\"mjx-c2192\" style=\"width: 1.591em;\"><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end></mjx-stretchy-h></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D442 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We can add the measures of two adjacent angles to find the measure of the combined angle.</p>\n<p>Therefore:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"22\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 12.183em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 1.143em; margin-bottom: -0.561em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s4\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.951em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D442 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D438 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 1.175em; margin-bottom: -0.561em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s4\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.951em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D442 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 1.177em; margin-bottom: -0.561em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s4\" style=\"width: 0px; margin-left: -0.951em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C6 TEX-S4\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D442 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D438 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-texatom><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0.3em; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0.3em; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"verti